const $=s=>document.querySelector(s);
const captions=[['The bucket lowers into the clay deposit.','The bucket curls and lifts a load of clay.','The excavator turns and releases clay onto the feed conveyor.'],['Clay clumps travel over the vibrating metal grid.','Smaller pieces fall through the grid onto the conveyor.','Counter-rotating rollers crush the clay into smaller pieces.'],['Sand is added to the screened clay.','Water is added to make the clay workable.','The ingredients are blended into a consistent mixture.'],['Choose moulding or wire cutting: these are alternative routes.','The mixture is shaped into uniform brick-sized pieces.','The newly shaped bricks are ready for drying.'],['Wet bricks enter the drying oven.','Moisture leaves the bricks during 24–48 hours of drying.','Dried bricks leave the oven and move to the kiln.'],['Dried bricks enter the first kiln section.','The bricks are heated at 200–980°C.','They proceed to the higher-temperature kiln section.'],['Bricks enter the high-temperature kiln section.','Firing continues at 870–1300°C.','The fired bricks leave the kiln for cooling.'],['Hot bricks enter the cooling chamber.','The bricks cool for 48–72 hours.','Cooled bricks are ready to be packaged.'],['Cooled bricks are arranged on a pallet.','Layers are stacked into a compact package.','The completed stack is secured for transport.'],['The packaged pallet is loaded into the truck.','The load is positioned for transport.','The truck carries the finished bricks away.']];
